[00:00.000] 作词 : Dani Giguere
[00:00.759] 作曲 : Dani Giguere
[00:01.519]The stars weep
[00:05.716]Porcelain rain
[00:09.908]Numb the lust, numb the pain
[00:18.131]She spills stardust
[00:21.117]With every clumsy incision she makes
[00:27.043]Wine drunk, painfully numb
[01:10.807]The flowers by your bedside
[01:15.004]Cry out for summer rain
[01:19.544]I taste of your lotus
[01:23.784]A blind moth to a flame
[01:27.818]All the birds have left your window
[01:32.272]And your friends will do the same
[01:37.089]Some things last a long time
